dent: 8px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          Vanilla, Chamomile, Lemon, Cranberry, Honey pomelo tea-like\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           这个产品是第三年测到了，之前没有选用是因为酒桶的风味太浓郁了，特别奶油香草，有点过于抢眼，虽然也能感受到咖啡的酸甜苦；今年的这个批次是无意中再次测样，想着我们有云南的葡萄酒桶，波本桶的桶内陈放发酵处理，可以和米兰的做个组合对照，测了发现wow开始喜欢它的美丽，上个月Andres来上海也和他一起测了Captain Mark，才知道去年底开始他开始调整这个产品的处理过程，也是希望它的香气和味道能更和谐，很棒！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 8px;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n          它入口是很奇妙的香草和洋甘菊组合，香气过后是很舒服的柠檬+红布林蔓越莓的果酸然后尾韵也有柚子茶和柠檬红茶的感觉\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n          ，第二口大口喝时尾韵还会出来一个树莓的香气，好喝，好特别～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           关于Milan庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-indent: 8px;outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n<strong>\n            // 文字来源于Amativo公众号\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          Milán农场，位于哥伦比亚Risaralda Pereira里萨拉尔达佩雷拉 ，种植面积200公顷。种植的品种有：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          Gesha 、Red Bourbon 、Yellow Bourbon 、Pink bourbon、Bourbon Tekisic 、Bourbon Sidra 、Striped Bourbon、 Tabi、Java 、SL 28 、 Catiope 、Sudan Rumé、Moka 、Laurina 、 Yirgacheffe 、Maragogype 、 Caturra 、 Purple caturra 、 Castillo 、Colombia。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          由于气候变化，这个地区的咖啡生产变得非常困难，昆虫的繁殖，丰收时又缺工人。目前，生产商的处境都非常艰难，但我们一直在创新，寻找研发更好的加工方式来满足市场需求。因为我们不能失去作为咖啡生产商的核心。我会用我的一生，一直在这里继续咖啡种植和生产。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          Milan与小溪\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           La Riviera属于一个公司旗下，他们还有一个烘焙品牌叫做Cafe Uba，办公室和烘焙工厂位于佩雷拉市区。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TNnM53wGuRkrhAqt8sjaNrINWyRQeJiaXT9uTiavgoP4MHu1BjXppDzmrOVrA3wRzo7uDtQVyJtDqQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           这里会发展成一个集合的加工处理中心\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          现在这里只能进行湿处理，而干处理是在不同的地方进行的，我们规划6个月后，开始解决这个问题。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Qnf7bcvw7va2NGME5pqP59bRs3nwKTH0M2vTx6Q76hldRdZz3wS8pe7BhMls6VHeYgGwAFTgqdRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          做了一些定制（开孔）的威士忌酒桶\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Qnf7bcvw7va2NGME5pqP593ZKU0icvqydgVINOu8TGENficTiabWxdDXZeENqoxYyqic55349YkudVhg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          为了保证风味的一致性和强度的浸渍养护的橡木片，发酵时橡木片也是放在桶内的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Qnf7bcvw7va2NGME5pqP59Sm8rkxT47TVUTfDCvsOx95wgMuia6WQSIhINIT0eIeWzICZU7o7mRGg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          用来搅拌均质的机械装置\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           关于本批次处理过程（分系列介绍）：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ol class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n            手选采摘成熟的咖啡果\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n            清洗咖啡果并再次手选\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n            将咖啡果进行有氧发酵\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n            去除部分果胶\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n            放入曾经用来陈酿威士忌的橡木桶\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n            并加入酵母进行发酵\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;text-align: justify;margin: 0px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n            完成后移至晒棚干燥至含水率达到11%\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
